    {
      "id": "strange-document/p2",
      "type": "text",
      "variant": "body",
      "content": "This is not an imperial decree or a story of war. It is an ordinary request from ordinary people. And yet, it shows how empires functioned: through continuous negotiation, documentation and local initiative. Paper made it possible for distant voices to reach the center — and to leave a trace.",
